  "narration": {
   "1": "The web shop sends POST /orders with the cart and the customer's token.",
   "2": "The API gateway rate-limits the caller and routes the request.",
   "3": "The auth service verifies the token. A bad token stops here with 401.",
   "4": "The orders service validates the cart and creates the order as pending.",
   "5": "The order is written to the orders database, keyed by an idempotency key.",
   "6": "The payment provider charges the card. A decline marks the order failed.",
   "7": "An order.created event goes onto the event bus.",
   "8": "The email worker picks it up and sends the receipt — the customer never waits for it."
  },
